   "text": "beforeSwap()\n  isArb = tip >= threshold\n  if first swap of block:\n    credit user impact\n\nafterSwap()\n  give each sleeve its fee\n  if first swap of block:\n    mark s*, charge loss\n\nbeforeAddLiquidity()\n  only the hook may add",
